  m_text: 'You and the CPU share the same numbers, shown at the top of the screen: one <color=#ECC470>Lucky Number</color> and <b>two</b> <color=#EC6262>Unlucky Numbers</color>. With the Joker, that makes 5 unlucky cards in the deck.

