      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Each customer has a <color=#ECC470>Lucky Number</color> and an <color=#EC6262>Unlucky Number</color>. Both are shown on screen when the reading begins, so you always know which cards to hope for and which to fear.

    - <color=#ECC470>Lucky Number</color>: 2 cards in the deck.

    - <color=#EC6262>Unlucky Number</color>: 2 cards in the deck. The Joker is always unlucky too, so there are 3 unlucky cards in all.

    The screen shows how many lucky and unlucky cards are still left in the deck.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
